* Phase reversal at tt / 1.8 V / 27 C: Vid swept from -1.8 to +1.8 V across the
* inputs (100 kohm from each input to VCM sets their common mode), each output
* returned to VCM through 1 kohm.  Iout = (Vop - Von) / 1 kohm must have the
* sign of Vid wherever abs(Vid) > 50 mV (around the null): iout_min_pos_a must
* be > 0 and iout_max_neg_a < 0.  Grading runs the same sweep at the nominal
* point and checks every sample.
* Run with `ngspice -b testbench/tb_phase_reversal_tt.spi`.
.lib "/opt/sky130/continuous/sky130.lib.spice" tt
.include "/app/circuit.spi"
.options reltol=1e-7 abstol=1e-16 vntol=1e-10
.temp 27
VDD vdd 0 1.8
VSS vss 0 0
IBIAS vdd ibias 10u
VCM vcm 0 0.9
R1 inp vcm 100k
R2 vcm inn 100k
VID inp inn DC 0
XDUT vss ibias vdd vcmpin inp inn outp outn fd_opamp
RVCM vcm vcmpin 1k
RGP outp vcm 1k
RGN outn vcm 1k
.control
set noaskquit
dc vid -1.8 1.8 0.01
let iout = (v(outp) - v(outn)) / 1k
meas dc iout_min_pos_a MIN iout FROM=0.05 TO=1.8
meas dc iout_max_neg_a MAX iout FROM=-1.8 TO=-0.05
quit
.endc
.end
